  "problemStatement": "Find the most general antiderivative of f(x) = 6x^5 - 8x^3 + 9x^2 - 4x + 7.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\int f(x) \\, dx = x^6 - 2x^4 + 3x^3 - 2x^2 + 7x + C",
  "steps": [
